    "text": "By Real Estate Newswire ,\n1 days ago The following is a listing of all residential property transfers in the North Syracuse Central School District reported in August. There were 71 transactions posted during this time. During this period, the median sale for the area was a 1,940-square-foot home on Chetwind Drive in Cicero that sold for $305,350. Read full article\n1",
